     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"line-break:after-white-space\">\r\n<div>This is a reminder that the DataLab speaker series continues tomorrow 10:30-11:30 in <u><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/location/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(18,100,163);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/location/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464260971000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Kqe1NWSmH9R5ETnk8jijG\">DataLab</a></u> and\r\n on <u><a href=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/meeting/register/adjlIkQOS0-GASMhXF7g_A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(18,100,163);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucdavis.zoom.us/meeting/register/adjlIkQOS0-GASMhXF7g_A&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464260971000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2IOLi8ulLucIx6we-aOXGX\">Zoom</a></u>. This week, Stefan Broecker (Computer Science) will talk about how\r\n to get started with the <code style=\"background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border:1px solid rgb(221,221,221);border-radius:3px;padding:2px 4px;font-family:Monaco,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace\">transformers</code> package and how he uses\r\n it in his own research on large language models, in a talk titled &quot;Using <code style=\"background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border:1px solid rgb(221,221,221);border-radius:3px;padding:2px 4px;font-family:Monaco,Menlo,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace\">transformers</code> to\r\n Run Language Models&quot;.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>We hope you&#39;ll join us!</div>\r\n<div>--</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div><b>Nick Ulle</b>, PhD (he/him/his)<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>Sr. Data Scientist at <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464260971000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2UR7AVv4rtkXNZLWVOqTaV\">DataLab</a><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>University of California, Davis</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
